<title>DUBAI: China Southern Airlines to start Sharjah service.</title>
<headline>China Southern Airlines to start Sharjah service.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Southern Airlines said on Tuesday it will start a twice-weekly service to Sharjah in the United Arab Emirates next month.</p>
<p>It said the Beijing-Urumqi-Sharjah flights will leave Beijing on Wednesdays and Saturdays. The flights will</p>
<p>return to China on Thursdays and Sundays. The service, on Boeing 757 aircraft, will begin on September 4. -- Dubai newsroom +9714-626990</p>
</text>
